<title>NEW ZEALAND: NatMut Holdings has 5 pct of Rest. Brands.</title>
<headline>NatMut Holdings has 5 pct of Rest. Brands.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Mutual Holdings said on Thursday it became a substantial security holder in Restaurant Brands during the day's session, and has a relevant interest in five percent of its voting securities.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
